    {
      "text": "Spread 1/2 tablespoon butter on one side of a slice of bread. Place bread butter-side-down onto the skillet bottom and place pepper Jack cheese on top. Top with chicken mixture. Butter a second slice of bread with remaining butter on one side and place on top of sandwich, butter-side-up.",
